// PORT: SOURCE TIME_OF_FREE_FALL.agc:232
//#		1. APOGEE RADIUS IS NOT MEANINGFUL FOR HYPERBOLA
// PORT: SOURCE TIME_OF_FREE_FALL.agc:233
//#		2. APOGEE RADIUS IS NOT DEFINED FOR PARABOLA
// PORT: SOURCE TIME_OF_FREE_FALL.agc:234
//#		3. APOGEE RADIUS EXCEEDS THE SCALING FOR ELLIPSE.
// PORT: SOURCE TIME_OF_FREE_FALL.agc:235
//#
